          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3.1 The Need for Smaller Units"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.332,
            0.42,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Sonu’s mother was fixing a toy. She was trying to join two pieces with the help of a screw. Sonu was watching his mother with great curiosity. His mother was unable to join the pieces. Sonu asked why. His mother said that the screw was not of the right size."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.434,
            0.326,
            0.849,
            0.519
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.434,
                0.326,
                0.849,
                0.519
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_0_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.534,
            0.848,
            0.591
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "She brought another screw from the box and was able to fix the toy. The two screws looked the same to Sonu. But when he observed them closely, he saw they were of slightly different lengths."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.592,
            0.607,
            0.803
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.171,
                0.592,
                0.607,
                0.803
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_0_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.616,
            0.59,
            0.848,
            0.81
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Sonu was fascinated by how such a small difference in lengths could matter so much. He was curious to know the difference in lengths. He was also curious to know how little the difference was because the screws looked nearly the same."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.809,
            0.848,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In the following figure, screws are placed above a scale. Measure them and write their length in the space provided."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
